.el .ds Aq '
.TH git-mora-tag 1  "tag " 
.SH NAME
git\-mora\-tag \- Tag the current attempt as pending, merge, or discard
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit mora tag\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Tag the current attempt as pending, merge, or discard
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
git\-mora\-tag\-pending(1)
Create the pending tag at HEAD (requires a clean worktree)
.TP
git\-mora\-tag\-merge(1)
Turn the pending snapshot at HEAD into a merge tag
.TP
git\-mora\-tag\-discard(1)
Turn the pending or merge snapshot at HEAD into a discard tag
